# No em dashes

Never write the em dash character (—) anywhere: UI copy, code, comments, docs, commit messages, or chat responses.

Use a comma, period, colon, or parentheses instead, or rewrite the sentence.

```tsx
// Bad
<p>Cooked — it's in the fridge</p>

// Good
<p>Cooked, it's in the fridge</p>
```
